>> Combination := Akojọ tuntun.

Combination nigbati: ['fi-kun-opin:'] ṣe: { :el
	ara-rẹ 
	ri: el, Ofo? otitọ: { ara-rẹ fi-kun-opin: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination tuntun.
colours
	fi-kun-opin: ['red'],
	fi-kun-opin: ['green'],
	fi-kun-opin: ['blue'],
	fi-kun-opin: ['red'].

Ijade kọ: colours, ila-tuntun.
